frontend tech
1) html
what is html
it is used to design the structure of a webpage

doctype
it specifies the type and version of a document

semantics-nav,header,footer,section,article
it conveys meaning about a content

meta tags- 
it provides the extra information about a webpage

block level elements- div,h1,p,table
it occupies the complete space  and always starts on new line

inline elements-span , a,button,input,img
it occupies the required space 

forms attributes - method=get or post ,action
input - name,class,id,type,placeholder,required


2) css
what is css
it is used to describe the presentation of a webpage

boxmodel
it is used to describe the presentation of a element
four components
1) content- width and height
2) padding
3) border
4) margin

what is positions
appearance and position of an element
1) fixed 2) sticky 3) relative 4) absolute  5) static
top bottom right left

flex box
it is one dimensional layout model that is used to create layouts

parent properties
1) display:flex;
2) flex-direction:row-reverse;
3) align-items:   controls the alignment on cross axis
4) justify-content: contols the alignment on main axis
5) gap- used to create a space between rows and cols

child properties
1) flex-basis
2) order


3) js
it is a programming language that is used to add dynamic nature
to the webpage

js datatypes
1) primitive - number,string,boolean ,undefined,null
2) non primitive- arrays,object and functions

var,let ,const
var a=10;

scopes
global- var,let and const
local scope- var,let and const
block scope{}- let and const

functions- reusable block of code that performs specific task 
          when something invokes it

types of functions
1) named functions
2) arrow functions
3) anonymous functions 

synchronous code-line by line execution
asynchronous code-parallel level of execution

let apilink='https://fakestoreapi.com/products'

fetch(apilink).then(data=>data.json())
.then(finaldata=>console.log(finaldata)
.catch(err=>console.log(err)


4) react
react - it is used build single page applications

features- spa, component based architecture

hooks 
1) useState - it is used to store data
2) useEffect- it is used to call an api
3) useNavigate- it is used for navigation
4) useRef-it is used to store form data
5) useMemo- it is used to improve the performance